    """
    Redirects users to a compatible abstract view based on the provided parameters.
    
    Parameters:
    - endpoint (str): The target endpoint for redirection.
    - confId (int): The conference/event ID.
    - friendly_id (str): The friendly ID of the abstract.
    - track_id (int, optional): The track ID if applicable.
    
