The provided source code is a Python script designed to perform local assembly of non-reference transposable element (TE) loci using reads from a parsed VCF file. It utilizes parallel processing to handle multiple SV (Structural Variants) entries concurrently, employing different assemblers and polishers based on user-defined parameters. The script also includes functionality to prepare input reads, run assembly and polishing steps, and merge the results.

## Classes and Structs

