This program defines a simple neural network using PyTorch, a popular deep learning framework. The `NeuralNet` class implements a feedforward neural network with four linear layers (fully connected layers), each followed by a ReLU activation function. The network takes an input vector, processes it through these layers, and produces an output vector without applying any final activation or softmax function.

### Classes and Their Purposes

#### Class: `NeuralNet`

