**Fields/Member Variables:**
- `l1`: A linear layer that maps the input size to the hidden size.
- `l2`: Another linear layer that maps the hidden size to itself.
- `l3`: Yet another linear layer that maps the hidden size to itself.
- `l4`: The final linear layer that maps the hidden size to the number of classes.
- `relu`: An instance of the ReLU activation function, used after each linear layer except the last one.

