**Purpose:**  
This class manages an ad-hoc communication connection, providing methods to connect to different types of ports, start listening, send messages, and manage subscriptions.

**Fields:**
- `closed`: A boolean indicating whether the connection is closed.
- `name`: A string representing the name of the connection.
- `mavlink_intermediate_status_`: A `mavlink_status_t` structure used for intermediate MAVLink status information.
