This C++ program implements Dijkstra's algorithm to find the shortest path from a starting node to all other nodes in a weighted graph. It also calculates whether the travel time exceeds a certain threshold (120 minutes) and outputs the travel time along with the optimal path.

### Classes and Structs

#### No Classes or Structs Defined

The provided code does not define any custom classes or structs. All functionality is encapsulated within functions and global variables.

### Global Variables and Standalone Functions

