- **Purpose:** Stores the adjacency list representation of the graph. Each element `graph[v]` contains pairs representing connected nodes and the corresponding edge weights.

#### `dijkstra(int start)`
- **Parameters:**
  - `start`: The index of the starting node.
- **Return Value:** None (outputs results directly).
- **Purpose:** Implements Dijkstra's algorithm to compute the shortest paths from the starting node to all other nodes in the graph. It also determines if the travel time exceeds 120 minutes and prints the travel
